@startuml
title DIAGRAM ARSITEKTUR (3-TIER ARCHITECTURE)\nSistem Pemesanan Kamar Kos / Homestay Online

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam node {
    BackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    BorderColor #2980B9
    FontName Arial
}
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #2C3E50
    FontName Arial
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #FEF9E7
    BorderColor #D35400
    FontName Arial
}

node "Client Tier (Presentation Layer)" {
    component "Web Browser\n(User & Admin)" as Browser
    component "UI Framework\n(Tailwind CSS / Bootstrap)" as UI
    Browser --> UI : Renders Interface
}

node "Web Server Tier (Application Layer)" {
    component "Apache Server\n(XAMPP / Laragon)" as WebServer
    
    package "PHP Native Application" {
        component "Front Controller / Router\n(index.php)" as Router
        component "Logic Controllers\n(auth.php, booking.php, admin_process.php)" as Controllers
        component "State Machine\n(state_machine.php)" as StateMachine
    }
}

node "Database Tier (Data Layer)" {
    database "MySQL Database\n(kosbooking)" as DB {
        [Tabel: users]
        [Tabel: rooms]
        [Tabel: transactions]
        [Tabel: cart]
        [Tabel: room_reviews]
    }
}

' Alur Interaksi Komponen
Browser ----> WebServer : 1. Kirim HTTP Request (GET/POST)
WebServer ----> Browser : 6. Kembalikan HTTP Response (HTML/CSS/JS)

WebServer --> Router : 2. Meneruskan Request
Router --> Controllers : 3. Memanggil Fungsi Logika
Controllers --> StateMachine : 4. Validasi Transisi Status Pemesanan

Controllers ----> DB : 5. Eksekusi SQL Query (PDO / MySQLi)
DB ----> Controllers : Mengembalikan Data Hasil Query

@enduml